# Keep secrets and local clutter out of the Docker build context.
#
# `.env` ships with this example so you can hand it to `--secrets-env`, which
# seals it to the BYOK key and delivers it to the workload at runtime on tmpfs.
# It must NOT reach the image: anything in the build context can be COPYed in,
# and a secret baked into a measured image is a secret you cannot rotate.
# `PKG-005` ("No .env / no secrets in build context", HIGH) checks this.
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Build/scan artefacts and caches — smaller context, faster builds.
.tee_crafter_scan/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
venv/
